  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.Holochain.HoloNET.ORM v4.1.4\n\nHoloNET ORM — a powerful Object Relational Mapping layer for Holochain hApps built on HoloNET Client. Upgraded to Holochain 0.7.0. Map .NET classes directly to Rust DHT entry structs with HoloNETEntryBase and HoloNETAuditEntryBase. Batch-load entire DHT collections with HoloNETCollection<T>. Bind WPF/XAML UIs reactively with HoloNETObservableCollection<T>. Full CRUD (LoadAsync, SaveAsync, DeleteAsync), change tracking, version control, and one-method rollback — all without writing any conductor wire-protocol code. Converts any existing .NET app to a Holochain hApp with minimal changes. Ships as both lightweight (no binaries) and embedded (hc.exe + holochain.exe bundled) variants. Part of the OASIS Omniverse at https://holonet.oasisomniverse.one -- Source: https://github.com/holochain-open-dev/holochain-client-csharp\n\nWhat's new since v4.1.2\n- Initial validated package contents and metadata for this release line.\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/HoloNET-ORM",
